        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 24 at 12:53PM AST by NWS San Juan PR</headline>
        <description>At 1253 PM AST, Doppler radar was tracking an area of strong
thunderstorms.

HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 40 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.
</description>
        <instruction>Monitor the weather situation closely and be alert for threatening
weather conditions.

If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
